#: ../../../developer/general/gsod.rst:201 d7e0f39fb87c4cf3a92b5acdb90233c7
msgid ""
"**Brief explanation**: Current qrexec (qubes remote exec) documentation is "
"hard to follow, important information is hidden within a wall of text. Some "
"parts are split into multiple sections, for example version specific to "
"avoid duplication, but it doesn’t help reading it. Additionally, protocol "
"documentation describes only few specific use cases, instead of being clear "
"and precise protocol specification. Fixing this last point may require very "
"close cooperation with developers, as the current documentation doesn’t "
"multiple corner cases (that’s one of the issue with its current shape)."
msgstr ""

